  "sn2.2:0.3": "2. Dutiyakassapasuttaṃ ",
  "sn2.2:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṃ. ",
  "sn2.2:1.2": "Ekamantaṃ ṭhito kho kassapo devaputto bhagavato santike imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsi – ",
  "sn2.2:2.1": "‘‘Bhikkhu siyā jhāyī vimuttacitto, ",
  "sn2.2:2.2": "Ākaṅkhe ce hadayassānupattiṃ; ",
  "sn2.2:2.3": "Lokassa ñatvā udayabbayañca, ",
  "sn2.2:2.4": "Sucetaso anissito tadānisaṃso’’ti. "
}
